    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. but if everyone is just focusing on their own security and \"de-risking\" like you said, doesn't that basically just kill the benefits of globalization? i feel like a lot of these policies are just moves to protect local industries that can't compete anymore, even if it makes things more expensive for everyone else. is it actually a good thing or is it just protectionism in disguise?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
